@startuml generate-report-activity
' Status: Draft - Reconciliation Incomplete. AI-reconciled; not human reviewed (Principle VII).
' Written source: data-model.md (Report), BR-19 to BR-21, DEC-12 to DEC-15
title Generate Report\nFR-034 to FR-037 (conditional draft: OC-1 open)

|User|
start
:Open Reports;
|UI|
:Load choices with filterOptions;
|User|
:Set optional from, to, group,
other user, and statuses;
:Generate;

|ReportService|
:PREPARE: check session; parse dates;
if (Dates valid, and from not after to?) then (no)
  |UI|
  :Show field error;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ReportService|
:Open one read-only scope;
:AUTHORIZE: compute visible scope;
note right
  Active groups: all records involving the user.
  Former groups: only items the user was part of (DEC-07).
end note
if (Group filter within scope?) then (no)
  |UI|
  :Show generic "not found" message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ReportService|
:Fetch matching expense rows
(creator, payer, or participant, by expense date,
other user on the same expense, by status);
:Fetch matching payment rows
(user is a party, by payment date, by other party,
not affected by the status filter);
:Fetch ledger entries of the user within
the group and other-user filters;

|ReportCalculator|
if (Any line matched?) then (no)
  :Empty lines, zero totals (not an error);
else (yes)
  :totalExpenseAmount, userShareTotal:
  matching **Approved** expenses only;
  :totalPaidByUser, totalReceivedByUser:
  matching settlement payments;
  :Status memo: count and amount per status,
  labeled "Not included in totals";
endif
:For each other user, split ledger entries by date:
opening (before from), period (from to to), later (after to);
:current = opening + period + later;
note right
  Ignores the status filter. Pending and Rejected
  never enter a total or a net (SC-005).
  current equals BalanceService for the
  same group scope, to the cent (FR-037).
end note

|UI|
:Render lines, totals, memo, reconciliation,
and "As of" generation time;
note right
  Reports are not stored. A later approval or a
  backdated item can change an earlier period
  when the report is run again (DEC-14).
end note
stop

@enduml
